日，還未到居延百餘里，匈奴遮狹絶道，陵食乏而救兵不到，虜急擊招降陵。陵曰：「無面目報陛下。」遂降匈奴。其兵盡沒，餘亡散得歸漢者四百餘人。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji109-089:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:p017","start":23,"end":26,"surface":"右賢王","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m017-0023","usage":"narrative","date_expression":"天漢二年秋"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"天漢二年秋出征敘事中的用稱，不作授任起年；貳師短稱連本段李廣利，單于及右賢王未具名，不按同稱跨年合併。數字紀年待核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:p017","text":"數歳，天漢二年秋，貳師將軍李廣利將三萬騎擊匈奴右賢王於祁連天山，而使陵將其射士歩兵五千人出居延北可千餘里，欲以分匈奴兵，毋令專走貳師也。陵既至期還，而單于以兵八萬圍擊陵軍。陵軍五千人，兵矢既盡，士死者過半，而所殺傷匈奴亦萬餘人。且引且戰，連鬬八日，還未到居延百餘里，匈奴遮狹絶道，陵食乏而救兵不到，虜急擊招降陵。陵曰：「無面目報陛下。」遂降匈奴。其兵盡沒，餘亡散得歸漢者四百餘人。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m017-0009","start":9,"end":13,"surface":"貳師將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"fyv_cvv_y5b","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m017-0013","start":13,"end":16,"surface":"李廣利","kind":"person","person_id":"fyv_cvv_y5b","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m017-0023","start":23,"end":26,"surface":"右賢王","kind":"person","person_id":"r03_tsm_2cn","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m017-0034","start":34,"end":35,"surface":"陵","kind":"person","person_id":"wdz_85c_o7f","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m017-0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"貳師","kind":"person","person_id":"fyv_cvv_y5b","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m017-0068","start":68,"end":69,"surface":"陵","kind":"person","person_id":"wdz_85c_o7f","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m017-0075","start":75,"e